# Frontend

- Studio pages: `/login`, `/register`, then a rail (`/work`, `/drama`, `/news`, `/knowledge`, `/account`) and `/watch/{id}` for a job. Types in `src/types.ts`, HTTP in `src/api.ts`. Do not put UI routes on `/jobs` (that prefix is the API).
- Two site themes: `brutal` (Khối thô, Space Grotesk, default) and `soft` (Gối mềm, Manrope). The admin (`operator`) sets it via `PUT /site/theme`; everyone reads `GET /site/theme`. Tokens in `index.css`, per-theme borders/shadows in `styles/skins.css`. CSS reads tokens, never raw hex (video frame excepted). No Inter, no purple AI gradient.
- Poll `/jobs/{id}` every 1.5s until `done` or `failed`. Stills use `dataFileUrl()` → `/files/...` (cookie-authenticated).
- `fetch` with `credentials: "include"`. Proxy `/auth` and `/attachments` too.
- Never label Ken Burns as I2V. If `artifacts.motion` exists, show that mode.
- Vite proxy: `/jobs`, `/health`, `/files`, `/site` → `http://127.0.0.1:8765`. Bind `server.host` to `127.0.0.1`.
- Do not add a UI library unless the page truly needs it.
